# 🎓 Learning Outcomes

- 🌞 Reading analog values using `analogRead()`
- 🚶 Detecting motion with a PIR sensor
- 💡 Controlling LED brightness using PWM (`analogWrite()`)
- ⏱️ Using `millis()` for timing events
- 🖥️ Displaying formatted timestamps on the Serial Monitor
- ⚙️ Building an energy-efficient embedded system

